# A text box's caret, selection and clipboard, as WinForms' TextBox has them.
#
# The parameter search box, because it shows with no vehicle: typed into, Ctrl+A selects all of
# it, Ctrl+C copies it to the system clipboard, Delete takes the selection, and Ctrl+V pastes it
# back - twice, at the caret. Home and Delete prove the caret moves and a key acts where it is;
# Shift+End and Ctrl+X cut through the clipboard too. params.search is the box's text,
# params.search.selection what is selected in it, `start,end` in characters, or `none`.
#
# Every key path is also a unit test without a window: crates/mp-gui/src/textfield.rs.
#
# Self-contained: tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/textfield-clipboard.gui

screen params
window 1600x1200
# A config.xml of its own, so the "Show me again?" box this script clicks is not already
# suppressed by the settings of the machine running it.
env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
settle 3
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

click param-search
type BATT
settle 1
expect params.search BATT
expect params.search.selection none

# Select all and copy: the text stays.
key ctrl+a
settle 1
expect params.search.selection 0,4
key ctrl+c
settle 1
expect params.search BATT

# Delete takes the selection; something typed, then the clipboard pasted after it, twice.
key Delete
type X
settle 1
expect params.search X
key ctrl+v
key ctrl+v
settle 1
expect params.search XBATTBATT
expect params.search.selection none

# The caret moves: Home, then Delete takes the character after it.
key Home
key Delete
settle 1
expect params.search BATTBATT

# Shift+End selects from the caret to the end; Ctrl+X cuts it, and Ctrl+V puts it back.
key Right
key Right
key Right
key Right
key shift+End
settle 1
expect params.search.selection 4,8
key ctrl+x
settle 1
expect params.search BATT
expect params.search.selection none
key ctrl+v
settle 1
expect params.search BATTBATT
